Subject: [PATCH 3275/3799] soh: rename D_8094A95C -> sScepterFlameOffsets

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the five points along the scepter the flame positions are recorded from
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c
index 07d7ef7d2..c4d10f6fd 100644
